<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>PoseArt - Login</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f5f0e8 0%, #e8ede9 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* Outer decorative container */
        .outer-container {
            width: 420px;
            height: 90vh;
            max-height: 800px;
            border: 1px solid #c9b896;
            border-radius: 24px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,252,245,0.6) 0%, rgba(240,245,240,0.4) 100%);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            position: relative;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }

        /* Diamond decorations */
        .diamond {
            width: 10px;
            height: 10px;
            background: #c9a961;
            transform: rotate(45deg);
            position: absolute;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(45deg);
        }

        .diamond.top { top: -5px; }
        .diamond.bottom { bottom: -5px; }

        /* Main card */
        .login-card {
            width: 85%;
            max-width: 380px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            border-radius: 28px;
            padding: 40px 32px;
            box-shadow: 
                0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08),
                0 12px 24px -8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
            text-align: center;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }

        /* Top pill */
        .top-pill {
            width: 160px;
            height: 32px;
            background: #1a3a3a;
            border-radius: 16px;
            margin: 0 auto 24px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        /* Typography */
        h1 {
            font-size: 42px;
            font-weight: 400;
            color: #1a2e2e;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
        }

        h1 span {
            color: #c9a961;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .subtitle {
            font-size: 17px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            color: #4a5568;
            margin-bottom: 36px;
            font-weight: 400;
            max-width: 280px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
        }

        /* Form elements */
        .form-group {
            text-align: left;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1.2px;
            color: #2d3748;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        input[type="text"],
        input[type="password"] {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 14px 16px;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 15px;
            background: #ffffff;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            outline: none;
        }

        input:focus {
            border-color: #c9a961;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(201, 169, 97, 0.1);
        }

        /* Submit button */
        .submit-btn {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 16px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d4af61 0%, #c9a961 100%);
            color: #1a2e2e;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-top: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(201, 169, 97, 0.3);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .submit-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(201, 169, 97, 0.4);
        }

        .submit-btn:active {
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        .arrow {
            font-size: 14px;
            opacity: 0.7;
        }

        /* Footer text */
        .footer-text {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #718096;
            line-height: 1.5;
            max-width: 300px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* Responsive adjustments */
        @media (max-height: 700px) {
            .outer-container {
                height: 95vh;
                border-radius: 20px;
            }
            .login-card {
                padding: 30px 24px;
            }
            h1 { font-size: 36px; }
            .subtitle { font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="outer-container">
        <div class="diamond top"></div>

        <div class="login-card">
            <div class="top-pill"></div>

            <h1>Pose<span>Art</span></h1>

            <p class="subtitle">
                Join photographers and models mastering their poses with Art Nouveau-inspired coaching.
            </p>

            <form onsubmit="event.preventDefault();">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="username">Username</label>
                    <input type="text" id="username" name="username" autocomplete="username">
                </div>

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="password">Password</label>
                    <input type="password" id="password" name="password" autocomplete="current-password">
                </div>

                <button type="submit" class="submit-btn">
                    Enter PoseArt
                    <span class="arrow">→</span>
                </button>
            </form>

            <p class="footer-text">
                Invite-only preview · Your session remains on this device and closes when this browser tab closes.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="diamond bottom"></div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
```
